### 1.0.0 Register New Company & Owner (عشان نجيب توكن جديد)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register-company
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "company_name": "Acme Corp",
  "tax_id": "123-456-789",
  "owner_full_name": "Test Owner",
  "owner_email": "owner@acme.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1.0.1 Login as Owner (عشان تجيب توكن الـ Owner)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "owner@acme.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1.1.0 Invite new HR to the company (عشان نجيب توكن جديد)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/users/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "full_name": "Test HR",
  "email": "hilay26742@bejum.com",
  "role": "HR_Manager"
}

### 1.1.1 Login as HR (عشان تجيب توكن الـ HR)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "hilay26742@bejum.com",
  "password": "8e1cc20e053142cabbd92e72b2c0d27c"
}

### 1.2.0 Create New Employee (HR Manager) -> Expected: 201 Created
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{HRToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "full_name": "Test Employee",
  "email": "u482t336hd@bwmyga.com",
  "job_title": "Developer",
  "department_id": "{{DepartmentId}}",
  "hire_date": "2026-07-01",
  "salary": 12000,
  "contract_type": "Full-time",
  "national_id": "29001011234567"
}

