  "email": "u482t336hd@bwmyga.com",
  "password": "7dd02b4b4aa14a30a8330c9cb42afcd5"
}

### 2. Create Department (Owner Only) -> Expected: 201 Created
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Engineering",
  "description": "Software Engineering & IT Department"
}

###

### 3. Get All Departments as Owner -> Expected: 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/departments?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}

###

### 4. Get All Departments as HR -> Expected: 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/departments?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{HRToken}}

###

### 5. Get All Departments as Employee -> Expected: 403 Forbidden
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/departments?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{EmployeeToken}}

###

### 6. Get Single Department by ID -> Expected: 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/departments/{{DepartmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}

###

### 7. Get Fake Department ID -> Expected: 404 Not Found
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/departments/{{FakeGuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}

###

### 8. Update Department (Owner Only) -> Expected: 200 OK
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/departments/{{DepartmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Software Engineering",
  "description": "Updated Department Description"
}

###

### 9. Delete Department (Owner Only) -> Expected: 204 No Content
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/departments/{{DepartmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{OwnerToken}}